Hits the target with your weapon doing [95%, 102%, 107%, 111%, 114% (TL1-5)] weapon damage. If the attack hits, the target is afflicted with Fiery Torment for 5 turns, reducing their fire resistance by [10%, 21%, 29%, 36%, 42% (TL1-5)].

When Fiery Torment ends the victim will take [46, 62, 75, 85, 95 (TL1-5; SP 100)] fire damage. This damage will increase by [16%, 22%, 27%, 30%, 34% (TL1-5; SP 100)] of all damage taken while under torment.

The damage dealt by the effect will increase with spellpower.

Demons under fiery torment will be burned by the flames of the Fearscape.
